# Build trees at the root, whatever their name
/build*/
*.o
*.obj
*.a
*.so
*.dylib
__pycache__/
.DS_Store
*.claude/*
*.claude

# Outputs of scripts/*_examples.sh and the dev/ checks: regenerate them (tests/README.md)
tests/examples/
# The full Ensembl GTF is too large to commit; tests/real_data holds the genes of its loci
tests/real_data/Homo_sapiens.GRCh38.116.gtf.gz

# Dated review write-ups, kept for the authors, not for users
docs/reports/
# Our own check of the docs against the binary
dev/check_docs.py
